{% block summary %}
<p>The application profile "Digital Water Meter" describes how water consumption in Flanders is monitored using digital meters. 
These meters are equipped with sensors that record water consumption and provide information about, among other things,
the type, manufacturer, and status of the meter. 
The consumption data, consisting of observations of water usage, provide insight into individual and
aggregated consumption, as well as in predicted consumption patterns. 
This profile provides a framework for collecting and sharing this data with third parties.</p>

<p>ISO19156:2011 is reused to align as much as possible with existing OSLO data standards, 
even if those URLs no longer resolve. 
To look up the definitions of those URLs, you can go
on
<a href="https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/sensoren-en-bemonstering/">
https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/sensoren-en-bemonstering/ 
</a>. . .</p>
